© Nintendo, Creatures, GAME FREAK and The Pokémon Company. MyVGC is not affiliated with them.

The images are not covered by MyVGC's licence, the GNU AGPL v3. No licence to them is granted
here.

They come from the Pokémon Champions icons in PokeAPI's sprites repository
(https://github.com/PokeAPI/sprites), resized to 96 × 96 and converted to WebP by
`pnpm sprites:update`. The pinned commit and the table of files are in
packages/core/src/sprites.ts. See docs/adr/0029-sprites-from-pokeapi-champions-icons.md.
